[{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4225573972", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/6138#issuecomment-4225573972", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/6138", "id": 4225573972, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G8773SRU", "user": {"login": "Momen-Walied", "id": 203645575, "node_id": "U_kgDODCNihw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203645575?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Momen-Walied", "html_url": "https://github.com/Momen-Walied", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Momen-Walied/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Momen-Walied/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Momen-Walied/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Momen-Walied/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Momen-Walied/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Momen-Walied/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Momen-Walied/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Momen-Walied/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Momen-Walied/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-10T17:32:47Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-10T17:32:47Z", "body": "Hey @simonArchipoff  I'd like to work on this. \nI've identified the issue in `tools/mcp_tool.py` - the tool result handler only extracts text content and ignores image/binary blocks with `.data` and `.mimeType` attributes.\n**Quick questions to make sure I build what you need:**\n1. **Return format** - For the image, should I return:\n   - Base64 data URL (embedded in JSON, works immediately with LLMs)\n   - File path (saves to disk, needs cleanup)\n2. **Image size limit** - Thinking 5MB max, sound good?\n3. **Your test server** - Is the `testmcp.tar.gz` you attached ready to test with? Any special setup needed?\nThe MCP sampling handler already supports images (converts to base64 data URLs), so I'll follow that same pattern for consistency.\nLet me know and I'll get started! \ud83d\ude80", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4225573972/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4233940009", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/6138#issuecomment-4233940009", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/6138", "id": 4233940009, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G878XMwp", "user": {"login": "simonArchipoff", "id": 55718116, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU1NzE4MTE2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55718116?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/simonArchipoff", "html_url": "https://github.com/simonArchipoff", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simonArchipoff/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simonArchipoff/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simonArchipoff/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simonArchipoff/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simonArchipoff/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simonArchipoff/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simonArchipoff/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simonArchipoff/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simonArchipoff/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-13T04:55:18Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-13T05:20:03Z", "body": "I guess it could take the same form of what is done for the files recieved by messaging systems ?\n```\n{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"[The user sent a document: 'C5924394.pdf'. The file is saved at: /home/simon/.hermes/cache/documents/doc_b443d220b147_C5924394.pdf. Ask the user what they'd like you to do with it.]\\n\\n\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-13T00:45:24.064870\"}\n```\n\nno need for arbitrary size limit I think (?)\n", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4233940009/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4950664673", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/6138#issuecomment-4950664673", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/6138", "id": 4950664673, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABJxUl4Q", "user": {"login": "teknium1", "id": 127238744, "node_id": "U_kgDOB5WCWA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127238744?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1", "html_url": "https://github.com/teknium1", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-07-12T09:20:38Z", "updated_at": "2026-07-12T09:20:38Z", "body": "<!-- hermes-sweeper:item=6138 -->\n<!-- hermes-sweeper:verdict=close reason=implemented_on_main confidence=high -->\nThanks for the concrete MCP image-server example and follow-up on using Hermes' existing file-delivery flow. This is already implemented on current `main` by an earlier fix.\n\n- Automated hermes-sweeper review verified `c8e3e3918509d4c43432ec2cf19ef6a1cfe9cd9c` (`fix(mcp): surface image tool results as MEDIA tags instead of dropping them (#21328)`), shipped in `v2026.5.7`.\n- `tools/mcp_tool.py:673` caches base64 `ImageContent` blocks and emits `MEDIA:<path>`; `tools/mcp_tool.py:3958`\u2013`3977` includes those tags in MCP tool results.\n- `gateway/run.py:18952`\u2013`18988` forwards current-turn tool-result media tags to platform delivery, and Telegram sends local images natively (`plugins/platforms/telegram/adapter.py:6040`\u2013`6067`).\n- Regression coverage is present in `tests/tools/test_mcp_image_content.py:55`\u2013`136`.\n\nThis closes the demonstrated MCP PNG/image case. Generic non-image media would need a separately scoped request.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4950664673/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]